## 10. Inline math

The solution is \ x = 2 \.
Pythagoras: \ a^2 + b^2 = c^2 \.
Comparison: \ x <= y \ and limit \ x -> infinity \.

## 11. Document structure

### Sub heading

- first item
- second item
+ third item
1. first step
2. second step

= Typst-style heading
== Typst-style sub heading

## 12. Tables and matrices

*table(Name ; Age | Alice ; 20 | Bob ; 22)

*matrix(1 ; 2 | 3 ; 4)
*mat(a ; b | c ; d)

*table(
    Name ; Age
    Alice ; 20
    Bob ; 22
)

## 13. Function plots

*plot(x^2; -5; 5)
*plot(sin(x); -10; 10)
*plot(1/x; -10; 10)

## 14. Geometry drawing

*draw(
    *point(A = 0, 0)
    *point(B = 4, 0)
    *point(C)

    *distance(A ; C ; 3)
    *perp(A ; B ; A ; C)

    *triangle(A ; B ; C)
    *right-angle(B ; A ; C)
    *angle(A ; B ; C)
    *length(A ; B) = 4
)

*draw(
    *point(O = 0, 0)
    *circle(O ; 3)

    *point(P)
    *on-circle(O ; 3 ; P)
    *line(O ; P)
    *label(P ; P)
)

// End of tour //
